       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BANKINT.
      *================================================================
      * SAVINGS INTEREST POSTING.  FIRST NATIONAL, BRANCH 07.  1978.
      * POSTS MONTHLY INTEREST FOR ONE YEAR, THEN KEEPS POSTING UNTIL
      * THE BALANCE PASSES THE TARGET.  YEARS ARE TWO DIGITS.
      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-OPEN-YY          PIC 99         VALUE 78.
       77  WS-CURR-YY          PIC 99         VALUE 26.
       77  WS-BALANCE          PIC 9(7)V99    COMP-3  VALUE 1000.00.
       77  WS-RATE             PIC V9999      COMP-3  VALUE 0.0525.
       01  WS-WORK-AREA.
           05  WS-MONTHLY      PIC 9(5)V99    COMP-3.
           05  WS-YEARS        PIC 99.
           05  WS-TARGET       PIC 9(7)V99    VALUE 2000.00.
           05  WS-ITER         PIC 9(5).
           05  WS-AUDIT-FLAG   PIC 9          VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM COMPUTE-ACCOUNT-AGE.
           PERFORM POST-YEAR.
           PERFORM POST-UNTIL-TARGET UNTIL WS-BALANCE > WS-TARGET.
           STOP RUN.
       COMPUTE-ACCOUNT-AGE.
      * 26 - 78 GOES NEGATIVE AND THE UNSIGNED FIELD DROPS THE SIGN.
           COMPUTE WS-YEARS = WS-CURR-YY - WS-OPEN-YY.
       POST-MONTH.
      * COMP-3 WITHOUT ROUNDED: THE FRACTION OF A CENT IS LOST EACH MONTH.
           COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY = WS-BALANCE * WS-RATE / 12.
           ADD WS-MONTHLY TO WS-BALANCE.
       POST-YEAR.
           PERFORM POST-MONTH 12 TIMES.
       POST-UNTIL-TARGET.
      * ON A TINY BALANCE THE MONTHLY INTEREST TRUNCATES TO ZERO
      * AND THE BALANCE NEVER REACHES THE TARGET.
           PERFORM POST-MONTH.
           ADD 1 TO WS-ITER.
       AUDIT-TRAIL.
      * NOBODY PERFORMS THIS PARAGRAPH ANY MORE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AUDIT-FLAG.
           DISPLAY 'AUDIT ' WS-BALANCE.
